          "text": "Health anxiety with excessive cancer worry, repeated checking, and reassurance seeking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left breast ultrasound"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ultrasound approximately 6 weeks ago: 9 mm simple cyst in the left upper outer quadrant, anechoic with a thin wall and no solid components; no abnormal axillary nodes; right breast reported as NAD. BI-RADS 2. Radiologist recommended no further imaging."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left breast discomfort"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent ache around the cyst, especially premenstrually, settles with simple analgesia and warm packs. Currently described as a mild twinge, not severe."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported breast and systemic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies nipple discharge, skin change, new lumps, weight loss, night sweats, and fevers. No red-flag breast symptoms reported at this visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cancer-related worry and checking behavior"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports marked worry about breast cancer, daily breast palpation, sometimes feeling the area is bigger but acknowledging variation with cycle and pressure, hours spent searching online about breast cysts and cancer, and repeated requests for further imaging including MRI."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep, mood, and suicidal ideation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sleep mildly impacted by rumination. No depression features volunteered today; denies suicidal ideation."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
